sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant SPA as Angular SPA
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant QM as Query Module
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (read_model schema)

    User->>SPA: Query prices for hotel/dates
    SPA->>GW: GET /api/prices?hotel=X&dates=Y
    Note over GW: Validate JWT, check hotel authorization
    GW->>QM: Internal REST: GET /prices?hotel=X&dates=Y
    QM->>DB: SELECT from materialized view
    DB-->>QM: Price data
    QM-->>GW: Price data (JSON)
    GW-->>SPA: HTTP 200 with prices
    SPA-->>User: Display prices